   "design": "A syllabus template fills dates and rooms from the timetable, readings from the reading list and assessment weights from the course catalogue, and the teacher checks it. Assignments and handouts start from drafts the teacher reads in full, with every reading resolved in the catalogue. Course templates handle formatting. A script downloads public survey data with its codebook for exercises. Learning goals, policies, rubrics, briefing assistants and their questions stay with the teacher.",
